text:
Ocean Networks Canada uses hydrophones from several manufacturers and distributors: the main ones being Ocean Sonics and JASCO Applied Sciences.
Most hydrophones are Ocean Sonics icListen smart hydrophones: icListen HF (High Frequency; 10 Hz to 200k Hz), and icListen AF (Audio Frequency; 10 Hz to 12 kHz). JASCO provides Geospectrum-manufactured hydrophones for multi-element directional arrays, great for localizing sources.






all_cols = {
  if (specs_data && specs_data.length &gt; 0) {
    return Object.keys(specs_data[0]);
  } else {
    return [];
  }
}

// 2. Define our labels based on the safe extraction
label_col = all_cols.length &gt; 0 ? all_cols[0] : ""
model_cols = all_cols.length &gt; 0 ? all_cols.slice(1) : []

// Extract the "Device" row (first row) and separate it from the rest of the specs
deviceRow = specs_data.length &gt; 0 ? specs_data[0] : {}
specRows = specs_data.length &gt; 1 ? specs_data.slice(1) : []

brandColors = ({
  "JASCO": "#D97706",
  "Ocean Sonics": "#0284C7",
  "Naxys": "#6D28D9",
  "Feature": "#334155"
})

// Helper function to dynamically check column string headers
function getBrandColor(m) {
  if (m.includes("JASCO")) return brandColors.JASCO;
  if (m.includes("Ocean")) return brandColors["Ocean Sonics"];
  if (m.includes("Naxys")) return brandColors.Naxys;
  return "#475569";
}

viewof selectedModels = {
  const picker = Inputs.checkbox(
    model_cols,
    {
      label: "Select Models to Compare:",
      value: [model_cols[0], model_cols[3], model_cols[4]],
      format: x =&gt; deviceRow[x] && deviceRow[x] !== "--" ? deviceRow[x] : x.split('.')[0]
    }
  );
  picker.classList.add("specs-model-picker");
  return picker;
}

html`
&lt;style&gt;
  .specs-model-picker {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .specs-model-picker,
  .specs-model-picker label,
  .specs-model-picker span,
  .specs-model-picker div {
    color: #f8fafc !important;
  }

  .specs-model-picker :has(&gt; label &gt; input[type="checkbox"]) {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-wrap: wrap !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 8px !important;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .specs-model-picker label:has(&gt; input[type="checkbox"]) {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 6px 14px !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    color: #f8fafc !important;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .specs-model-picker label:has(&gt; input[type="checkbox"]):hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) !important;
  }

  .specs-model-picker label:has(&gt; input[type="checkbox"]:checked) {
    background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.28);
    border-color: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.7) !important;
  }

  .specs-model-picker input[type="checkbox"] {
    margin: 0 !important;
    accent-color: #38bdf8;
  }

  .table-responsive {
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: auto;
    max-height: 600px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
  }

  .branded-table {
    border-collapse: separate;
    border-spacing: 0;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: "Open Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .branded-table th {
    padding: 16px 12px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .branded-table td:first-child,
  .branded-table th:first-child {
    position: sticky;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    background-color: #334155;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: left;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    min-width: 220px;
  }

  .branded-table th:first-child {
    z-index: 15;
    background-color: #334155;
  }

  .branded-table td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background-color: #1e293b;
    min-width: 160px;
  }

  .branded-table tr:nth-child(even) td:not(:first-child) {
    background-color: #243044;
  }

  .mfg-row td {
    font-weight: 700 !important;
    color: #f8fafc !important;
    background-color: #334155 !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
  }

  .mfg-row td:first-child {
    background-color: #334155 !important;
  }
&lt;/style&gt;

&lt;div class="table-responsive"&gt;
  &lt;table class="branded-table"&gt;
    &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
        &lt;th style="background-color: ${brandColors.Feature};"&gt;Specification&lt;/th&gt;
        ${selectedModels.map(m =&gt; {
          let deviceName = deviceRow[m] && deviceRow[m] !== "--" ? deviceRow[m] : m.split('.')[0];
          return html`&lt;th style="background-color: ${getBrandColor(m)}"&gt;${deviceName}&lt;/th&gt;`;
        })}
      &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/thead&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr class="mfg-row"&gt;
        &lt;td&gt;Manufacturer/Supplier&lt;/td&gt;
        ${selectedModels.map(m =&gt; html`&lt;td&gt;${m.split('.')[0]}&lt;/td&gt;`)}
      &lt;/tr&gt;

      ${specRows.map(row =&gt; html`
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;${row[label_col]}&lt;/td&gt;
          ${selectedModels.map(m =&gt; {
            let val = row[m];
            let style = val === "--" ? "color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic;" : "";
            return html`&lt;td style="${style}"&gt;${val}&lt;/td&gt;`;
          })}
        &lt;/tr&gt;
      `)}
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
  &lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
`

































































Information about suppliers and manufacturers





JASCO Applied Sciences
A scientific consulting firm and equipment supplier specializing in underwater acoustics. Founded by Joseph Arnold Scrimger in Victoria, British Columbia, in 1981, the company now has its largest primary operations office in Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada.
JASCO operates globally across national defense, marine environmental stewardship, oil and gas asset monitoring, and academic research. They also perform acoustic modeling, field data collection, and advanced analysis suites.
Their Autonomous Multichannel Acoustic Recorder (AMAR) provides passive acoustic data acquisition with high bandwidth and low noise.
Their hydrophones are manufactured by GeoSpectrum Technologies Inc.







GeoSpectrum Technologies Inc. (GTI)
A specialized Canadian aerospace and defense company, based in Halifax, NS, that focuses on the design, engineering, and manufacturing of underwater acoustic transducers and specialized systems. GeoSpectrum hydrophones are high-performance, and frequently deployed as part of hydrophone arrays managed by JASCO.







Ocean Sonics
Ocean Sonics is a canadian, Nova Scotia-based pioneer in the development of smart digital hydrophones, found in 2005. They have developed both low-frequency (icListenLF/AF) and high-frequency (icListenHF) hydrophones.







Wildlife Acoustics
A US-based private company based in Maynar, MA specialized provider of bioacoustics monitoring technology founded in 2003 by Ian Agranat. Their primary focus is on designing autonomous underwater recorders and sound analysis software for ecosystem biodiversity monitoring, environmental assessments, and wildlife presence/absence surveys.
Their hydrophone Song Meter SM2M, released in 2011, is designed for long-term autonomous deployments.
